<section id="s-gap" data-code="gap">
<div class="section-no">01 &mdash; The Gap</div>
<h2>Why Community Drafters Underperform</h2>
<p>Speculative decoding speedup depends on <strong>&tau;</strong> &mdash; the average acceptance length, how many draft tokens the target model approves per verification pass. The speedup formula is S = &tau; / (1 + &gamma;&middot;c), where &gamma; is the speculation budget and c is the drafter's relative cost.</p>
<p>SpecForge (arXiv:2603.18567) ran a controlled experiment: keep everything identical &mdash; same architecture, same hyperparameters, same target model (LLaMA-3.1-8B-Instruct) &mdash; and swap only the training dataset.</p>
<div class="math-block">
<div class="math-label">The acceptance-length gap &mdash; same architecture, different data</div>
ShareGPT (120K) + UltraChat (200K) = <span class="math-var">320K conversations</span>
  &rarr; &tau; = <strong style="color:var(--amber)">2.82</strong> on Math500  <span class="math-comment">&larr; official EAGLE-3 checkpoint [SpecForge, 2026]</span>

Open-PerfectBlend (1.4M, balanced domains)
  &rarr; &tau; = <strong style="color:var(--green)">3.48</strong> on Math500  <span class="math-comment">&larr; SpecBundle checkpoint [SpecForge, 2026]</span>

Delta: <strong style="color:var(--cyan)">+23.4%</strong> acceptance length &rarr; <strong style="color:var(--cyan)">1.17&times;</strong> inference speedup
</div>
<p>A 23% boost in &tau; with zero architectural change. The improvement was largest on math and code: SpecBundle delivered 1.61&times;&ndash;4.48&times; throughput over the ShareGPT+UltraChat baseline on those tasks. The community checkpoints were blind to domains they were never trained on.</p>
<div class="vp">
  <div class="vp-head">
    <span class="vp-title">acceptance length by domain &mdash; same architecture, different training data</span>
    <span class="vp-hint">scroll to trigger</span>
  </div>
  <div class="vp-body">
    <div class="results-bars" id="gap-bars">
      <div style="font-size:.68rem;color:var(--muted);font-family:var(--ff-mono);margin-bottom:.75rem">LLaMA-3.1-8B-Instruct &middot; EAGLE-3 architecture &middot; &tau; (bar = &tau;/5 &times; 100%)</div>
      <div style="font-size:.7rem;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:.4rem;font-family:var(--ff-mono)">&blacktriangleright; ShareGPT + UltraChat (320K conversations)</div>
      <div class="bar-row">
        <div class="bar-label">Chat (MT-Bench)</div>
        <div class="bar-track"><div class="bar-fill" data-w="74" style="background:rgba(107,114,128,.5)"><span>3.70</span></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="bar-row">
        <div class="bar-label">Math (Math500)</div>
        <div class="bar-track"><div class="bar-fill" data-w="56" style="background:rgba(107,114,128,.5)"><span>2.82</span></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="bar-row">
        <div class="bar-label">Code (HumanEval)</div>
        <div class="bar-track"><div class="bar-fill" data-w="52" style="background:rgba(107,114,128,.5)"><span>2.63</span></div></div>
      </div>
